  "title": "Air-Fried Mozzarella Cheese Bites with Spicy Marinara Sauce",
  "description": "These mozzarella sticks are coated in Italian-seasoned bread crumbs, cooked until crispy in the air fryer, and served with a zesty marinara dipping sauce.",
